# =====================================================================
# Release V076 -- Retire immediate_forward_utilisation (-> Diary Fill forwards)
# =====================================================================
# Diary Fill and Immediate Forward Utilisation are the SAME metric (booked/scheduled hours
# / available diary hours) -- Immediate Forward was just a hardcoded "next 7 days" snapshot.
# Replaced by measuring Diary Fill over a forward date window on the report ('List Date
# Unconstrained' heatmap axis + relative-date slicer), so it retires here (Is_Active=0).
#
# Catalog only re-seed (MERGE + post-seed UPDATEs are idempotent). The forward heatmap
# itself is the bespoke [Diary Fill (Forward)] measure in TabularEditor_Scheduling.csx
# (Tabular Editor re-apply, not a warehouse deploy).
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V076__retire_immediate_forward_utilisation.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Config.Metric_Definitions.Data.sql

TEST
